            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Nhà Sin",
            "review_text": "Trip17307708271\n1 contribution\n0\nFor those who like to eat fresh cows.\nApr 2026 • Friends\nI love the steak here. The beef is very soft, the taste is not too fat. My favorite is the fresh meat in this restaurant. Because I am a steak enthusiast, I went back to the restaurant to enjoy it. This is served only in the afternoon. I usually go to lunch with my colleagues. It doesn’t make me lose friends, the fragrance cows have no causative smell that I usually encounter when eating steaks. I love it and will be back with my family. The service here is also very careful!\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 19, 2026",
